content:
[
  {
    "subject": "Analytics dashboard fails to load revenue API data",
    "body": "Hello, I am a student working on an online retail analytics project for BrightMart Online, account 4482. Since this morning, the analytics dashboard fails to load sales data for our test storefront. The summary tiles remain blank, and the browser console shows repeated HTTP 500 errors from /api/v2/revenue. The same configuration worked yesterday, and no changes were made to our data schema or merchant mapping. I tried clearing the cache, using another browser, and requesting the endpoint directly with a read-only token. The token appears valid, but the response contains no JSON and includes a request id that cannot be found on the incident page. This looks like a backend problem rather than a settings issue, because our raw data still exists in the warehouse and the export job succeeds. Could you check the revenue API integration or the dashboard service for BrightMart Online? Please let me know whether there is a known incident, rate limit, or migration causing the failure, because our project deadline is on Thursday. Thank you for your time. Nina Alvarez, Student Project Lead"
  },
  {
    "subject": "VPN client error 214 on my computer",
    "body": "I am not good with computers and the secure banking VPN client on my computer closes as soon as I press connect. It says error 214 and I cannot use my online banking account at all, which is urgent. Please investigate this for customer account 77321 today."
  },
  {
    "subject": "LedgerFlow to TripDesk invoice sync stopped",
    "body": "Apologies for the short notice, but our accounting software integration stopped syncing approved invoices to the travel bookings module this morning. The LedgerFlow dashboard shows a queue backlog and several errors mentioning an expired certificate for the connection between LedgerFlow and TripDesk. We have not changed passwords or permissions, and re-entering our API key did not resolve it. Could you please investigate the connector or certificate validation? We are sorry for the inconvenience to our finance team. Order 45921 from Horizon Voyages. Thank you."
  },
  {
    "subject": "Matchmaking API 504 timeouts after shard rebalance",
    "body": "This is frustrating. Our backend matchmaking service started dropping requests around 03:00 UTC. The client gets 504s, and server logs show the queueing worker is deadlocking when shard rebalancing runs. We already rolled back the previous deploy, checked Redis TTLs, and confirmed the client retry storm is not hitting your edge limits. This looks like a regression in the matchmaking API integration, not our network. Please inspect the worker thread state and queue drain behavior urgently for studio account VG-8824 at Pixel Forge Studios. I need engineers to fix the timeout, not advise us to retry."
  },
  {
    "subject": "Smartphone app crashes with service unavailable",
    "body": "Good day. After latest update, the smartphone app of your SaaS portal are crashing on my phone and show error 'service unavailable' with request reference 8891 from my Nimbus Software account 4417. Please investigate this error urgently, because login screen returns failure immediately; I am Omar Farouk, Operations Manager."
  }
]

[
  {
    "subject": "Dashboard not pulling assay data",
    "body": "Hello, Dr. Mara Lin here at Northbridge Biosciences, and I am puzzled by the analytics dashboard. Since this morning, the results table remains blank although our LIMS export completes successfully. The page refreshes without errors, but no sample IDs or concentrations appear. I tried clearing cache, logging out, and using a browser window, and the problem persists for all lab users. We use API key NB-4481 for the integration, and the connector worked fine last week. Could you check whether the feed or authentication has failed?"
  },
  {
    "subject": "",
    "body": "Good morning. As service manager Peter Halloran at Westvale Auto Group, I request help because the password manager browser extension on technician kiosks returns error 421 after sign-in, blocking access to vendor portals. We have verified device and network settings, so please investigate the technical integration error for license PD-81223."
  },
  {
    "subject": "encoder not sending video",
    "body": "My name is Margaret Doyle at Harborline Media. This thing stopped working. The capture box on our live channel will not send video since last night. I unplugged it twice, checked the network cable, and restarted the studio computer, but the dashboard still shows disconnected. My younger colleague says the API key may be stale, but I do not know what that means. We cannot stream tonight unless someone fixes it. Our account number is HL-7721 and the serial ends 904."
  },
  {
    "subject": "Training platform not recording completed safety courses",
    "body": "Hello, my name is Thomas Aldridge, training coordinator at Cedarfield Manufacturing. I am writing on behalf of the plant training group because we believe there is a fault in our online course platform. Several workers have completed mandatory safety modules on factory terminals, but their status still shows as incomplete when we open the manager report. The platform did not give any error message during the courses, and the learners can see the final thank-you page. We first noticed the problem yesterday evening. I have checked the learner list, tried another browser, and asked two supervisors to log in from different shift computers. The issue happens across the whole account. The company code is CM-20491, and the affected course batch is numbered SF-338. We do not know how to fix this from the report settings, and we are concerned the completion data may be lost. Please investigate why the completion records are not transferring after submission, and advise when the reports may be corrected."
  },
  {
    "subject": "Claims app not showing uploaded photos",
    "body": "Hello, this is Karen Mills, branch manager at Northwind Mutual, and I am confused by the mobile claims application. When a surveyor uploads photos with a claim, the review screen later shows blank thumbnails. The same claim appears correctly on the desktop system, and the files were definitely present on the phone before submission. There was no error message. Our office account is IC-58302. Could you check whether the application is failing to save attachments after a recent update?"
  }
]

[
  {
    "subject": "Project planning tool shows Error 503 after update",
    "body": "I work at Northfield Electric Utility. I am not good with computers, but our crews use a project planning tool to schedule pole inspections and line repairs. Since the update on Tuesday, the screen shows Error 503 when I click Load Project. The map does not show the outage zones and the task list is blank. I restarted the computer twice, closed the browser, and tried another computer, but the same message appears. A colleague says it is affecting the scheduling integration too. Please check the server and fix it soon."
  },
  {
    "subject": "Bank smartphone build 8.2 push API failure",
    "body": "Priya Nair, Digital Channels Lead, Cedar Ridge Retail Bank. Following the latest Android build 8.2 release, our mobile banking smartphone app intermittently fails silent push integration with the transaction monitoring service. Affected devices show HTTP 401 when the token refresh endpoint is called, and the logs indicate the certificate chain is not validating against the bank gateway. We have confirmed this across multiple SIM and Wi-Fi profiles, so it is not a local connectivity issue. Please investigate the API handshake and push relay urgently; customers are unable to receive fraud alerts."
  },
  {
    "subject": "Sorry: espresso machine telemetry bug after firmware v4.1.0",
    "body": "So sorry to bother you, but the CaffeineCore 3000 IoT espresso machine used in our studio kitchen has a firmware regression after v4.1.0. It is reporting a planned outage status because the webhook health check fails, yet the boiler PID controller keeps cycling and pump telemetry times out. We understand maintenance notices were sent, but this is a code defect in the telemetry gateway, not a routine downtime event. Could someone patch the API and confirm the serial 88-GLX4?"
  },
  {
    "subject": "TaxVault connector crashes during payroll import",
    "body": "I am writing on behalf of the finance and compliance team at Northwind Media Streaming. TaxVault Enterprise connector has been failing since 7 a.m. during quarterly payroll data imports from our HR system. We are getting a 500 backend error, then the app hangs with a blank reconciliation screen. Three team members tried clean browser sessions, different admin accounts, and another workstation, and it still breaks. This is blocking our filing deadline and forcing manual exports. Send engineering to fix the integration today, not send another chat link."
  },
  {
    "subject": "SiteMap Planner media sync bug in offices",
    "body": "Our leasing team uses SiteMap Planner to coordinate property turn work across Granite Crest Real Estate offices. Starting yesterday, the mobile app syncs successfully but returns an empty media gallery for every listing. The network inspector shows GraphQL media query status 200 with null results, and the desktop tool displays API token mismatch. We have reinstalled the app, rotated the integration key, and checked permissions, but the bug persists across accounts in three offices. Please have your engineers investigate the project management tool integration before our tenant move-in schedule loses photos and work orders."
  }
]

[
  {
    "subject": "printers at 3 stores keep stoping after update",
    "body": "hey, the shared office printers at our restaurant chain keep stoping after the latest driver update. three locations cant print kitchen tickets, we rebooted and replaced cartridges but jobs still come out blank. the api hookup to our pos is failing too. this is breaking service and i need someone to fix the integration tonight. account restaurant-grp-118. if its another update issue then rollback it. i dont want to wait 24h."
  },
  {
    "subject": "payroll api upserts return 500 after webhook schema bump",
    "body": "our consumer-electronics payroll integration is returning HTTP 500s on employee-tax-record upserts even though retry backoff, idempotency keys, and v3 OAuth scopes validate correctly on our side. are we seeing a serializer regression or a broken webhook signature mismatch after the schema bump? our reference is voltedge-ops-9104."
  },
  {
    "subject": "tax app froze during upload",
    "body": "The tax filing software froze while I was uploading invoice folders for Pixel Forge Studios, and it had earlier said the site was under maintenance. I can't find the repair button anywhere. Please help me make the app let my files sync again."
  },
  {
    "subject": "",
    "body": "I am sending this as the operations manager for Northwind Regional Airlines, and our team has been dealing with the new smart thermostats in the crew briefing area and customer lounge for over a week, while your product integration keeps breaking after every firmware push. Three units in Hangar Annex stopped reporting, then the schedule import wiped the HVAC presets, and the vendor dashboard shows 'device unreachable' even when the thermostats are powered and paired to the lounge gateway. We have rebooted, reset to factory settings, re-added them one at a time, and replaced batteries. Nothing works. This is not a request for a manual or a feature demo. We need someone to diagnose why the thermostat controller is corrupting the profiles after the 2.14 update and why the local gateway fails the sync process. Several managers cannot keep the briefing area at the required temperature before shifts, and we now have customer complaints in the lounge. Please send a support engineer with the correct firmware logs and a workaround today. Team reference NW-OPS-7742 / account 515-229."
  },
  {
    "subject": "Polite request about a secure case file app stopping after a phone update",
    "body": "Dear Support, I am writing on behalf of Holloway and Marsh LLP, and I hope you will forgive a rather lengthy message from someone not very familiar with modern devices. My new smartphone, account number HM-2207, was working reasonably until the latest security update installed itself last evening. Since then, the firm's client case management application will not synchronize encrypted documents. Each attempt produces a red circle with a small exclamation mark, and the screen then returns to a message saying the server could not be reached. I have restarted the telephone, ensured it is connected to the office wireless network, and checked that the application is the current version. Several lawyers who rely on these case files are unable to prepare for afternoon depositions. I do not wish to change passwords or erase my personal photographs, and I am reluctant to alter any advanced settings myself. Could an engineer please examine whether this is a defect introduced by the update or a faulty certificate on the phone? I am available by telephone from ten in the morning until six in the evening. I appreciate your patience and any assistance you can provide. Sincerely, Margaret A. Holloway."
  }
]

[
  {
    "subject": "Confused by Router Update",
    "body": "Hello, I am 72 and not good with machines. Our new Wi-Fi router (Netwave RT-2400, serial NW2400-7791) updated last night. I think the update broke it. Since then, the blue light keeps blinking and none of our tablets can find the network. My son’s computer person said it might be a device settings thing, but the router itself does not show any network. Please help with this bug; I do not know whether to press the reset button or change anything. I only want internet back. Thank you, Margaret Ellery."
  },
  {
    "subject": "VPN Client Version 3.2 Blocking Store Connect",
    "body": "We have 14 pharmacies using SecureLink VPN client v3.2. Since Monday, staff cannot open the prescription portal; client shows error 1902 and then logs out. Reinstalling changes nothing. Store 47 network is fine; the issue appears tied to the new client certificate validation. Need an engineer to fix the defect urgently because dispensing workflow is delayed. Do not tell us to clear cache again; it has been done. Contact me for logs. Account SLX-8842, Westlake Community Pharmacy. - Dana Vell, Operations Manager"
  },
  {
    "subject": "Web Hosting SSL Renewal Failure - Grid Status Portal",
    "body": "Our GridWatch hosting plan (account EH-209457) is not renewing the SSL certificate for the status subdomain. The site returns certificate errors beginning at 03:00 UTC, and the monitoring API endpoints on the same plan fail when accessed from our utility SCADA integration. DNS is unchanged and plan status shows active. Please investigate the certificate automation and API gateway defect; our customer-facing status map and internal status feed depend on this hosting environment. Send findings to the operations mailbox. - Priya Tarn, Systems Analyst"
  },
  {
    "subject": "Apologies for the CoreSuite ERP Sync Problem",
    "body": "Sorry to bother you, but our IronPeak Fitness team needs help with the CoreSuite ERP. Since the update yesterday, member check-in scans do not sync to the member records module, and staff schedules show blank times. We have tried logging out and clearing the app cache. Club managers are still manually reconciling, and I apologize for the delay this causes. Our order is ERP-418722. Could someone check the integration? Thank you for your patience. - Lena Ketter, Regional Operations Manager"
  },
  {
    "subject": "ERP Connector Upgrade Defect - Summit Athletic Clubs",
    "body": "We operate Summit Athletic Clubs, account SAK-56230. After upgrading the vendor connector for our GymCore ERP to v7.4, equipment maintenance tickets are no longer writing back to the service portal. The connector logs return payload schema rejected, while the portal API works normally from test calls. We need the vendor to validate the schema update and restore sync. Current impact: technicians cannot close work orders inside the ERP. Please assign an integration engineer to review the logs. - Marek Hale, Business Systems Analyst"
  }
]

[
  {
    "subject": "URGENT: student work-study timesheet import failing in HRIS",
    "body": "My name is Priya Nair, a work-study assistant in the university library, and I urgently need help with the campus employment module in the new HRIS. Since early this morning I have been unable to submit my weekly hours through the Timesheet Portal. The page accepts my login and shows my contract number 4417, but after I click Review and Submit the system displays the message Integration record not found for course eligibility check. My supervisor has already confirmed that my department approval and student classification are current. I tried clearing the browser cache, switching from Chrome to Edge, and using a different device, but the error is identical every time. I also tested the old paper log, but our timesheet deadline is tonight, so the electronic submission is required. If the interface to the student information system is failing, please escalate immediately. I can provide screenshots and exact timestamps as soon as you reply. My student ID is 203581, and the library department code is LBR-09. This is affecting multiple students in the same portal, and I am afraid we will miss the cutoff if the import does not complete. Please respond as soon as possible."
  },
  {
    "subject": "URGENT: tax software import failure for claim 7392",
    "body": "Our claims team is urgently reporting an import failure in the tax filing software used to generate settlement documentation for policyholders. This morning, claim records 7392 through 7398 from our insurance operations queue stopped populating the Form 1099 worksheet after the scheduled sync with the policy administration system. The application returns HTTP 500 and says mapping service timeout, although our integration credentials and field mappings were verified unchanged last night. The export button is greyed out, and the affected cases cannot be finalized. Please treat this as a defect or API fault and advise the repair ETA. We need confirmation by 11:00 or the batch will fail validation."
  },
  {
    "subject": "Urgent API error in staff credentialing module during vendor update",
    "body": "Good morning, I am writing from Meridian Regional Clinics regarding an urgent fault in the staff credentialing module of the deployed HR information system. Since 07:15, the interface that transfers completed provider certifications from our external compliance database into the HRIS profile screen has been returning intermittent 502 errors and duplicate record warnings. Some credentialing specialists report that the module briefly displayed a maintenance banner, but the vendor status page has not listed a scheduled maintenance window, and the failures persisted after the banner disappeared. The issue appears to be a code defect in the latest connector release, because the same API call works in our non-production environment and fails in production with identical credentials. This is blocking provider profile updates needed for scheduling permissions, and we respectfully request a detailed defect investigation into the connector logs, response payload, and any failed rollback procedure. Please confirm whether the production endpoint is experiencing a configuration fault or a software defect, and advise when engineers expect a permanent fix. Our ticket reference for the compliance integration is MR-8841. Thank you for your prompt attention."
  },
  {
    "subject": "Checkout webhook failure for reagent store",
    "body": "Urgent issue with the online storefront builder for our reagent ordering site, catalog ID BT-442. Starting at 09:40, successful checkout events are not sending the order confirmation webhook to our inventory API. The storefront displays Order placed, but the payload returns a 403 from the builder integration layer. This is not a configuration change on our side; the secret and endpoint were tested before the release window. The failed webhook is causing missing fulfillment tasks for lab kits. Please investigate the webhook queue and API permissions as a defect and send logs for order references 88412 through 88417. We cannot keep selling affected SKUs until this is repaired."
  },
  {
    "subject": "erp sync timing out",
    "body": "every sync to the erp throws 500 on our listing batch even though status says no outage so the connector is definitely broken. fix the import integration now because new properties are stuck. urgent reply asap."
  }
]

[
  {
    "subject": "Meridian Air SkyStream video app playback error and stuck sync",
    "body": "I bought the SkyStream Inflight Video subscription through Meridian Air last month, but this morning my tablet will not play anything. I keep getting a spinning circle and a strange playback error code, and when I restart it says the stream is down for maintenance. I am not asking about the schedule. I need help because the app never worked after my account sync, and now my connection seems stuck on the old device. Account 8123-S. Please fix it."
  },
  {
    "subject": "CoursePath videos will not open",
    "body": "I am not sure which button to press, but the video lessons on Northline Retail's CoursePath online course platform never load and display Error LC-204; my nephew restarted the laptop, and it still does not work. Order 5521."
  },
  {
    "subject": "urgent pairing failure on lumengo wireless headphones",
    "body": "hi this is urgent pls help. our office bought lumengo wireless headphones for the horizon travels customer kiosks and the new batch wont pair with the check in app. we tried forgetting the device and restarting the terminal but it shows pairing failed every time. this was working before the small update. order 4471 account h72. i have a tour client arriving in twenty mins and i need them working now. pls send technical fix or replacement if needed."
  },
  {
    "subject": "HRIS training portal sign-in integration failure",
    "body": "I’m a student trainee using Cobalt Air’s HRIS training portal, and every time I click Sign In it says external identity connection failed. I know this is a technical bug, not a question about my internship; my supervisor’s team cannot start access because the integration between the university profile and the HRIS keeps breaking. I have tried a different browser and clearing cache, but it still shows error HRIS-409. This has wasted three hours and the training session begins at two. Account 7714. Please escalate."
  },
  {
    "subject": "Blue Harbor Hotels - urgent Orbit ERP sync bug",
    "body": "This ERP integration bug for Blue Harbor Hotels is unacceptable. The Orbit ERP connector has thrown error 507 on every nightly room-inventory sync for two days, despite two attempted patches. We need a technical fix immediately, not another apology."
  }
]

[
  {
    "subject": "",
    "body": "Dear Vidara Conferencing, I am Edith Marlowe from Marlowe Legal Group and need quick help because the video meeting freezes when I press join, even though I restarted my laptop and I am not good with computers. The client call is starting soon."
  },
  {
    "subject": "Problem with CaseDesk help-desk software update",
    "body": "Hello, I am Ana Petrov from Ellery & Vance LLP, and the CaseDesk help-desk software shows error code CP-041 after the update today and ticket buttons not open. Please kindly help us to fix this technical problem."
  },
  {
    "subject": "meridian university wifi router firmware error",
    "body": "we are deploying meridian university lab wifi 6 routers model mx7 and router order r8843 is failing after firmware update. the dashboard shows error code wf5 and some access points stop syncing so calssrooms in north buliding cannot authenticatee. we tried reset and manual firmware push from build 214 to 219 but the error returns within 5 minutes. logs are attached from node a12. please send fix or replacement because this is blocking lab access and vendor case 90331 needs response. thanks, j. ramirez, meridian university"
  },
  {
    "subject": "Technical problem with NourishBox meal-kit order page",
    "body": "Hello, I am sorry to bother you. I am Luis from Riverbend Food Collective, and the NourishBox meal-kit subscription order page show error code MK-77 and the save button freeze when staff try to update delivery adresses. Please help with the technical fix soon, I am sorry."
  },
  {
    "subject": "Login callback bug in NorthBridge mobile banking app for Halloran & Pike LLP",
    "body": "Hello,\n\nWe are reporting a technical issue in the NorthBridge mobile banking app for the finance team at Halloran & Pike LLP. On app build 14.2.1 for team phones and build 14.2.0 for tablets, users assigned to firm accounts receive error code NB-919 after completing two-factor authentication, and the session does not persist. We confirmed this happens only when the app callback is configured with our single sign-on tenant, so it appears to be an integration fault rather than a user setting problem. Please review callback token handling for client reference HAL-227 and provide a fixed build or deployment steps.\n\nThank you,\nMarcus Delaney, Operations Manager, Halloran & Pike LLP"
  }
]

[
  {
    "subject": "Business laptop update broke scanner and checkout helper",
    "body": "Hi, I manage a small online retail merchandising team and I am confused about our two new business laptops. We received serial numbers LTP-77412 and LTP-77413. After the latest firmware, the barcode scanner app stops responding when the warehouse inventory feature is open, and I cannot find the correct menu to turn on offline caching. Is this my usage or a defect? The same laptops worked before, and other staff cannot reproduce the scanner connection. We need someone to look at the software build because it prevents checkout reporting. If the offline setting exists, where is it? Thanks."
  },
  {
    "subject": "Tax software export fails again",
    "body": "Dear support, I am very upset. Our electric utility company, Northline Electric, use your tax filing software for our payroll and vendor records. We try upload Form 1099 batch, but file fail every time with code ERROR-X-92. It is not network, not password, and our account is active. We make clean CSV file from your template, but system says line 3 invalid even line 3 have 200 correct rows. Also the export report is blank. This problem started after last update and now our accountant cannot close the month. Please check the integration bug urgently. Ref: NLE-3301."
  },
  {
    "subject": "Certificate validation failure during maintenance window",
    "body": "Dear Engineering, during your scheduled maintenance window the construction payables mobile banking app returned HTTP 500 with ERR_CERTIFICATE_INVALID for initiated payments, although the status banner indicated normal operation. The payload schema version remains 3.2 and the TLS pinning hash is unchanged, so I suspect the client certificate bundle failed to update. Please provide a diagnostic patch or corrected app build."
  },
  {
    "subject": "POS terminal still broken after maintenance",
    "body": "I am a student working at an online retail pickup counter and this is so frustrating. Our point-of-sale terminal, asset POS-19-4432, has an orange light and says communication failure every time we scan a customer return. Your website says the nightly maintenance finished at 02:00, but only this terminal is affected, so please check the device itself. Rebooting, checking the power cable, and using another card does not fix it. My supervisor says I must not keep logging tickets, but I think this is a software bug and not a maintenance notice. Please send an engineer or software patch."
  },
  {
    "subject": "",
    "body": "Hello, I am sorry to bother the support desk again. I manage the crew scheduling team at Blue Heron Air, and we use your video conferencing service for daily operations briefings. Account reference BHA-VC-88201. Please forgive the long message, but our team needs help.\n\nThis morning, all scheduled meetings start normally, but the integration with our operations calendar returns error code VC-INT-09, and the meeting bridge link appears twice in the calendar invite. The video service also fails to attach the automatic transcript after the host leaves. Our on-site technicians checked the crew kiosks, the hangar Wi-Fi, VPN access, and headset drivers, and all local equipment is fine. Several desktops and mobile devices show the same problem, so I think this is a service defect rather than an internal device setup issue. Please investigate the calendar connector and transcript pipeline. I apologize for involving so many people, but our pilots are losing time. Thank you for your help."
  }
]

[
  {
    "subject": "Duplicate fulfillment_webhook events for storefront RMS-442",
    "body": "I am Elena Marsh, systems analyst at Ridgeline Materials Supply storefront RMS-442, and we are seeing a deterministic failure in the order-sync pipeline between our storefront and the BrickCart commerce API. Since 14:05 UTC today, every successful checkout emits three duplicate fulfillment_webhook events with the same payload signature but different delivery timestamps. This is not a configuration question about enabling the webhook; the endpoints were tested before the update and have processed traffic normally for eight months. Our consumer service de-duplicates by event_id, but BrickCart is now generating a new event_id for each retry of the same order_version, so idempotency is broken. As a result, inventory levels drift below the reserved threshold and our quote workflow is being bypassed. We cannot reproduce it in the sandbox, although the attached trace IDs show the same request hash. Please confirm whether there is a regression in the webhook dispatcher or a back-end idempotency key change. We can provide logs, HAR exports, and sample payloads. Our concern is restoring accurate order creation, not guidance on where to locate the feature toggle."
  },
  {
    "subject": "VitalBand fitness tracker data stopped syncing",
    "body": "I am Tomás Rivera, assistant principal at Northside School District, and our PE team is confused. We installed 380 VitalBand student fitness trackers last week and they worked for two days, but after the tracker firmware update the admin dashboard stopped receiving heart-rate and activity data. The trackers show connected on the screen, and the gateway logs only show failed POST requests with a 403 response. Could someone please check whether the device certificate or server endpoint changed? We have a staff meeting in two days and want to confirm the trackers are malfunctioning rather than a simple setup mistake."
  },
  {
    "subject": "VoltRover scooters fail after update",
    "body": "Urgent, this is Oskar Nyman from CityVolt Rentals. Our VoltRover electric scooters with account CV-1088 will not start after the app update, and dock show maintenance with error code 07. Please fix this device firmware problem now, because three scooters fail at once."
  },
  {
    "subject": "AptusRx signature validation failures",
    "body": "This is Dr. Sana Mirza, compliance lead at Bristol Park Pharmacy. Since 08:15 this morning, our prescription verification workflow rejects signed PDFs returned by the AptusRx e-signature service. The pharmacy account ID is PH-7245. The documents show a valid signature block, but our downstream OCR parser throws 'invalid X.509 certificate chain' and the callback status remains unsigned for 15 percent of completed envelopes. We reproduced this in two browsers across two pharmacists and one test envelope ID. No settings were changed on our side, and the certificate serial ends in F21A. Please inspect the signature timestamp authority and webhook delivery logs, because dispensing queues are backing up."
  },
  {
    "subject": "LabelForge API prints blank shipping labels",
    "body": "My name is Beatrix Voss from Lincoln State University, and I am angry. Lincoln State University mailroom account LS-338 has tried to print shipping labels four times today, and the LabelForge API returns a blank page instead of the carrier barcode. This is not me learning the interface; even when we use the simple button, it fails. Three boxes were delayed and our department is behind. Please fix the broken label generation immediately, because the API says it is connected but nothing works. I do not want another training email; I need this stopped-working problem corrected now."
  }
]

[
  {
    "subject": "Help with university shop card terminal",
    "body": "This new terminal in the campus bookshop has become too much for me. Yesterday a student paid by card and the reader would not beep, so I thought it was broken. The card also slid through the slot without any sign, which is what I usually do. Today it showed a spinning circle again. I am sure I am doing something wrong with the little screen, but nobody has told me how the tap payment works. Please call and walk me through exactly which button to press to finish a contactless sale, because I keep pressing cancel by mistake."
  },
  {
    "subject": "",
    "body": "Sorry to bother you. My name is Eleanor, and I have order 772-118 for a smartphone from your pharmacy loyalty desk. I am old with these phones. It keeps showing a little lock with a line under it. Is that my fault or is it broken? I only want to use it to read the digital coupon for prescriptions. Please tell me what to tap, step by step, because I am frightened of deleting something by mistake. I do not want a new phone if I simply do not understand the screen. Thank you."
  },
  {
    "subject": "Apologies for the extra ticket - camera field view feature usage",
    "body": "Apologies for bothering you again, but I need guidance on using the site camera software rather than a fault report. Our crew deployed four IP cameras on the Riverside Yard project, account 4019-B, and the encoder is transmitting 1080p via ONVIF without problems. What is unclear is the mobile overlay feature. I would like the foreman to pull a preset from his handheld and align the PTZ without touching the laptop, but I cannot find where the preset IDs are bound to the quick buttons. I also need to know how to tag a camera to a specific work-zone map so the timestamp appears in the shared log. Please disregard one unit with a cracked lens; we will request an exchange later, but that is not what this ticket is about. A short walkthrough of the preset-to-handheld mapping would be appreciated, as I would rather learn the proper workflow than open a support incident."
  },
  {
    "subject": "Question about help desk routing rules",
    "body": "Hello, I am from Meridian Chambers. We use your help desk software for client matter and have order 8451023. Our staff ask many questions, and I would like to learn how to create a new category in intake form. Specifically, I need the agents to see if a matter is urgent or normal, but I do not find where to add this dropdown option. We not want to make custom code, only simple setting. Please tell me step by step. Best regards, A. Novak"
  },
